{"id":"01a03f85-5cd0-7b1b-802c-39220891feed","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.5.3.3","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.5.3.3\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: short address to IID\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:44:15.923414Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:09:28.871404Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:09:28.871404Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:14:28.871404Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-26T19:09:28.871404Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.5.3.3\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.5.3\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:44:16.356441Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented Zephyr/C short-address IID module and production CMake integration. Mapping is byte-exact RFC 6282 0000:00ff:fe00:XXXX with big-endian XXXX, reverse canonical-prefix validation, explicit 0x0000/0xfffe/0xffff reserved classification, and fail-before-mutation errors. Dedicated shared vector table mirrors test/vectors/ipv6-addresses.json and adds 0x0000/0xfffd/0xfffe boundaries. Gates: standalone strict C + UBSan 1/1 passed; Clang static analyzer clean; local Zephyr qemu_cortex_m3 build/run 4/4 passed (FLASH 21879 B, RAM 5480 B); Python ipv6 parity 34/34; Rust lichen-core ipv6/short-address vector parity 9/9 using isolated target dir; diff check clean. native_sim configure was attempted but Zephyr POSIX architecture rejects macOS as Linux-only; qemu_cortex_m3 provided the local Zephyr execution path. clang-tidy/clang-format are not installed; strict compiler, analyzer, and Zephyr build were used.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-26T19:21:39.792728Z"}
